OL,4,BArgentina midfielder Paredes collapses 
OL,5,Bduring TV interview                    
OL,6,GWorld Cup winning midfielder Leandro   
OL,7,GParedes collapsed while giving a post- 
OL,8,Gmatch interview minutes after winning  
OL,9,Ga trophy with Boca Juniors.            
OL,11,FThe former Paris St-Germain            
OL,12,Fmidfielder, 32, was suffering with the 
OL,13,Fheat and humidity in Barranquilla,     
OL,14,FColombia, where Boca won the Copa      
OL,15,FSudamericana by beating Atletico       
OL,16,FMineiro of Brazil 2-0.                 
